WEBVTT

00:02:59.049 --> 00:03:00.819
What kind of chimpanzee are you?

00:03:00.843 --> 00:03:02.256
Are you a nice chimpanzee?

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:03.933
Are you an evil chimpanzee?

00:03:03.957 --> 00:03:05.401
Are you trustworthy?

00:03:05.425 --> 00:03:08.478
If I don't know you, how can I
cooperate with you?

00:03:09.676 --> 00:03:13.427
The only animal that can combine
the two abilities together

00:03:13.451 --> 00:03:18.747
and cooperate both flexibly
and still do so in very large numbers

00:03:18.771 --> 00:03:20.401
is us, Homo sapiens.

00:03:20.973 --> 00:03:25.104
One versus one, or even 10 versus 10,

00:03:25.128 --> 00:03:27.697
chimpanzees might be better than us.

00:03:28.112 --> 00:03:33.291
But, if you pit 1,000 humans
against 1,000 chimpanzees,